.SH NAME
geni\-uploader\-details\-snapshot \- snapshot existing\-source metadata to a private file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B geni\-uploader details\-snapshot
.BI "\-\-manifest " "MANIFEST"
.BI "[\-\-token\-file " "TOKEN_FILE]"
.BI "[\-\-confirm " "CONFIRM]"
.BI "\-\-output " "OUTPUT"
.BI "[\-\-state " "STATE]"
.B [\-\-sync\-state]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Writes a private snapshot of each listed source's current metadata to \-\-output. The output path is private and is never committed. Read\-only against Geni.
.SH OPTIONS
