file outside the repo holding the access token
.TP
.BI "\-\-confirm " "CONFIRM"
pass YES to authorize repair writes; anything else refuses
.TP
.BI "\-\-output " "OUTPUT"
private output path for the snapshot (required by snapshot) (required)
.TP
.BI "\-\-state " "STATE"
durable repair state file path (required by repair)
.TP
.B \-\-sync\-state
commit and push the state file back to the repository after repair
.TP
.B \-\-help
Show a short summary and the option list, then exit.
